.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-DB-RESPACE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-db\-respace \- Copy the store into a term space
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu db respace\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-into\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy the store into a term space
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-into\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
New integer namespace space number
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
